  "body": "Prove the sharp tariff for paid UT3 central calls\n\nExact positive uniform tariff for k UT3 central targets when rank-one calls of a,b,c are all paid, for every finite register count with restored arbitrary dirt.\n\nREADME.md proof, CERTIFICATE.json, verify.py; 14 mixed fixtures, full dirty endpoints, faithful independent action and omissions.\n\nReproduce: `python3.12 scripts/research_package.py --package research/ut3-priced-central-calls`. Positive and meaningful failure controls run under Python 3.12.\n\nScope and remaining obligations are in the package README. No selected frontier change or new kappa. Prepared for woklerx with substantial OpenAI Codex assistance; Apache-2.0.\n\nBase: `0b1cccf86e2f5132ed286a26ef0a681a495740ea`. [Coordinated research batch](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/discussions/1163#discussioncomment-18922638); round 01. The selected record is unchanged.\n",
